NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE

`twenty-nine-fine.mp3` — the track *Twenty-Nine Fine* — is not licensed under
the MIT License. All rights are reserved. It is included in this repository so
the app can play it offline, not so it can be redistributed.

The reason is specific rather than precautionary: the track was generated with
Suno, and the rights a Suno account holds in its output depend on that
account's plan and on Suno's terms at the time of generation. Sublicensing it
to the world under MIT would grant rights this repository cannot be certain it
holds. If that changes, this carve-out can be removed.

Everything else in this repository — `index.html`, `sw.js`, `guia.html`, the
README and the verification file — is MIT.
